abstract: >
  Three open engines testing whether macro-social systems obey structural
  law: a fragmentation census across natural and social systems (Horton–
  Strahler with Kirchner-null discipline), a five-pillar / six-tier country
  modernization instrument with an authoritative claims ledger and sealed forward flags,
  and a separate mechanical 15-feature classifier over 109 polity-formation cycles
  in 30 cases. All claims are tagged by epistemic status; retired theories
  are preserved with their kill evidence.
